20.02.1022 Specified sexual activities.
"Specified sexual activities" means:
1.	Human genitals in a state of actual or simulated sexual stimulation or arousal;
2.	Acts of human masturbation, sexual intercourse or sodomy;
3.	Fondling or other erotic touching of human genitals, pubic region, buttock or female breast;
4.	"Sexual intercourse," "sexual contact" or "deviate sexual intercourse" as defined in Section 21.01, Texas Penal Code.
(Ord. 16653 § 2 (part), 2007)
